<p>Hello {{ hostName }},</p>

<p>Good news: your session "{{ sessionTitle }}" has been accepted for {{ editionName }}.</p>

<p>Please review your session one last time and confirm it once its content is final. After confirming, you can no longer edit it yourself.</p>
{%- if note != "" %}

<p>A note from the organizers:</p>

<p>{{ note | escape | newline_to_br | raw }}</p>
{%- endif %}

<p><a href="{{ sessionUrl }}">Review and confirm your session</a></p>
